ungeon</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tExecowtioners fight until death.<br/><br/>An execowtioner attacks in melee range. An execowtioner never retreats.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tDon't let their appearance fool you, as their attacks can be stronger than those of a <a href=\"#/wiki/Behemoth\">Behemoth</a> or a <a href=\"#/wiki/Destroyer\">Destroyer</a>.\n</p><p><b><a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">Paladins</a>:</b> Throw fire walls on the ground and run around them, while healing constantly, for their distance attacks are very strong. Don't let them touch you, and if that happens, be ready to cast salvation, because their melee attacks may hit more than 400 when you're wearing no shield.\n</p><p><b><a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knights</a>:</b> Reach them as soon as possible, as they can spam their strong <a href=\"#/wiki/Whirlwind%20Throw\">Whirlwind Throw</a> up to three times in a row if they are not hitting you with Melee. Try to lure them away from other Minotaurs, as their high amount of Hit Points combined with their very strong combos and the attacks from other Minotaurs can spell doom even on the most experienced Knights.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 8,896 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span 